  "ruleText": "Fis 502.04 Molesting Gear. No person shall molest, pull, tend, or disturb any gear as specified in RSA 214:34-c.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at chapter headings for Fis 400 and Fis 500) #5016, eff 1-1-91(from Fis 406.04), EXPIRED: 1-1-97\n\nNew. #6432, eff 1-21-97; ss by #8120, eff 7-16-04; ss by #10279, eff 2-28-13; ss by #13532, eff 2-1-23; ss by #13798, eff 11-1-23",
